namespace UObjectToolTips

UIToggle:bAutoFindToggleGroupInParent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIToggle.h#UIToggle:bAutoFindToggleGroupInParent
    src   "When Awake, if ToggleGroup is not set, enable this will find toggle group in parent component and up hierarchy."
    text  "在Awake时，若未设置ToggleGroup，启用此项将在父组件及向上层级中查找切换组。"
    state machine
}

UIToggle:GetIndexInGroup {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIToggle.h#UIToggle:GetIndexInGroup
    src   "If this toggle added to a ToggleGroup, then return index in group. Return -1 if not add to ToggleGroup.\nIndex is sorted by flatten-hierarchy-index, from RootComponent(UIItem)."
    text  "如果此切换控件已添加到ToggleGroup，则返回其在组中的索引。如果未添加到ToggleGroup，则返回-1。\n索引按扁平化层级索引排序，从根组件RootComponent(UIItem)开始。"
    state machine
}

UIToggle:GetOnColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIToggle.h#UIToggle:GetOnColor
    src   "The two colours the checked transition moves between, the counterparts of UUISelectable's\nnormal/hovered/pressed setters. Same reason those exist: a toggle assembled by code rather than\nin a details panel has no other way to say what checked looks like."
    text  "已选中过渡在两种颜色之间切换，对应UUISelectable的\n正常/悬停/按下设置器。它们存在的原因相同：由代码而非\n细节面板组装的切换控件，没有其他方式表明已选中状态的外观。"
    state machine
}

