UIToggle:SetAutoFindToggleGroupInParent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIToggle.h#UIToggle:SetAutoFindToggleGroupInParent
    src   "Settable because Awake reads it: a control assembled in code runs before Awake and could\nnever reach this EditAnywhere flag -- the same reflection-only hole every part reference had."
    text  "之所以可设置，是因为Awake会读取它：由代码组装的控件在Awake之前运行，\n永远无法访问此EditAnywhere标志——这与每个部件引用都有的仅反射漏洞相同。"
    state machine
}

UIToggle:SetIsOn {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIToggle.h#UIToggle:SetIsOn
    src   "Aliases in the spelling the binding system derives from the property: bIsOn's setter is\nSetIsOn by the naming rule, and until these existed a toggle could not be bound at all --\nFindDreamWidgetSetterFor found nothing and DUI5005 blamed the author."
    text  "别名采用绑定系统从属性派生的拼写：按命名规则，bIsOn的设置器为\nSetIsOn；在这些别名存在之前，切换控件根本无法绑定——\nFindDreamWidgetSetterFor找不到任何内容，DUI5005会把责任归给作者。"
    state machine
}

UIToggle:SetToggleTransitionTarget {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIToggle.h#UIToggle:SetToggleTransitionTarget
    src   "What the CHECKED transition tints -- deliberately a different visual from the hover one, see\nApplyValueToVisual.\n\nThe property is EditAnywhere, so the designer and .dui have always been able to reach it by\nreflection while no caller could. A toggle assembled in code has to name its own tick."
    text  "已选中过渡所着色的对象——有意与悬停状态采用不同的视觉效果，参见\nApplyValueToVisual。\n\n该属性为EditAnywhere，因此设计器和.dui一直能够通过\n反射访问它，而调用方却不能。由代码组装的切换控件必须自行指定其勾选标记。"
    state machine
}

